The '''choke devil''' is a [[superior]] variant of the [[dust devil]]. It has a chance of spawning after purchasing the unlock ''Bigger and Badder'' for 50 [[Slayer reward point|Slayer reward points]] from any [[Slayer master]]. Like their standard variant, a [[facemask]], [[Slayer helmet]], or [[Slayer helmet (i)]] is required to safely engage them, otherwise the player will take rapid damage and have their stats drained.

==Drops==
''In addition to 100% drops and tertiary drops, superior slayer monsters will always roll 3 additional items, of which only 1 roll may be from the superior unique table. The other rolls are performed on the regular counterpart's table; their displayed drop chances represent a single roll.''

